      <then>
        <custom_item>
          type        : FILE_CHECK
          description : "5.2.1 Ensure access to /etc/ssh/sshd_config is configured"
          info        : "/etc/ssh/sshd_config is the main configuration file for the OpenSSH server daemon (sshd), which manages secure remote logins and other SSH services.

More information about the openSSH server configuration is available in the \"Configure SSH Server\" section overview.

